{"id":"f45e31a03f051bd8","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-delta2-non-ce-degree.md","title":"0′ 以下存在非 c.e. 的非零度","display":"cor-delta2-non-ce-degree — 0′ 以下存在非 c.e. 的非零度","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-delta2-non-ce-degree","aliases":["20-cor-delta2-non-ce-degree"],"display":"cor-delta2-non-ce-degree — 0′ 以下存在非 c.e. 的非零度","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.3.6","source_printed_pages":[139],"source_pdf_pages":[173],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-generic-exists]]","[[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]","[[20-thm-generic]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-delta2-non-ce-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-delta2-non-ce-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-delta2-non-ce-degree — 0′ 以下存在非 c.e. 的非零度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.3.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>139</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>173</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54d630bb92c94299\" href=\"?note=54d630bb92c94299\" title=\"20-thm-generic-exists\">20-thm-generic-exists</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6f4e11aea39794a8\" href=\"?note=6f4e11aea39794a8\" title=\"20-thm-generic-biimmune\">20-thm-generic-biimmune</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f631e6ce6349072c\" href=\"?note=f631e6ce6349072c\" title=\"20-thm-generic\">20-thm-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>对集合版 generic 使用特征函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 为上游 c.e. 度集合。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"54d630bb92c94299\" href=\"?note=54d630bb92c94299\" title=\"20-thm-generic-exists\">20-thm-generic-exists</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6f4e11aea39794a8\" href=\"?note=6f4e11aea39794a8\" title=\"20-thm-generic-biimmune\">20-thm-generic-biimmune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f631e6ce6349072c\" href=\"?note=f631e6ce6349072c\" title=\"20-thm-generic\">20-thm-generic</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}non\\text{-}ce\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf g\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf g\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\land\\mathbf g\\notin\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}non\\text{-}ce\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf g\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf g\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\land\\mathbf g\\notin\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(G\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 的 1-generic。双免疫性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 非可计算（否则无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 本身就是无限 c.e. 子集）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\equiv_TW\">\\(G\\equiv_TW\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> c.e.，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\le_TG\">\\(W\\le_TG\\)</span>，由 generic 的 c.e. 锥回避得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 可计算，进而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 可计算，矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.3.6；印刷页 139；PDF 第 173 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-generic-exists","status":"resolved","id":"54d630bb92c94299","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-generic-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-generic-biimmune","status":"resolved","id":"6f4e11aea39794a8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-generic","status":"resolved","id":"f631e6ce6349072c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-generic-exists","status":"resolved","id":"54d630bb92c94299","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-generic-exists]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-generic-biimmune","status":"resolved","id":"6f4e11aea39794a8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"